 entity  that i don't think actually seeing him  could really ever live up to that oh and  i should also mention that gojo's  explanation of how tengen operates was  pretty perfectly spot-on as someone who  grew up watching digimon the idea that  we like metal greymon but don't want him  to become skullgraymon so yeah it's  better to just reset him back to coramon  made this situation ridiculously clear  if possible  i would prefer digimon analogies for all  arcs please now funnily enough this is a  bit of a strange arc that actually seems  to blend into the next one because the  final chapter of the arc spent about  half of its time wrapping up gojo's past  and the other half brazenly marching  forward into our next adventure which  commences with the discovery of the  filthy  mole which turns out to be a mecca mole  but the most intriguing part about this  is definitely the further discussion  about binding vows  because it is very intriguing that even  mahito was ultimately  unwilling to break said binding val due  to the completely unknown penalties  which is fair enough considering that  even sukuna seems to regard these vows  as some pretty serious business but that  makes me want to see someone break one  all the more  and as we conclude with the setup of a  newly reinvigorated makamaru about to  face off against majito  i do wonder if this will affect his  heavenly restriction in any way  because it's not really a restriction  anymore if the restriction part doesn't  exist so will his power be affected as  well or is mahinto just a glorified  cheat the system sort of existence with  his soul manipulating prowess i'm afraid  i don't have the answers to this  currently so i should  probably go and find out so that pretty  much does it for this bind review of  jujutsukai sen's hidden inventory arc  and what do you guys think please do  leave your thoughts in the comments  below or even join my discord server and  if you're keen for some more juju to  sorcery then please do check out some of  my other videos or even subscribe to the  channel for very maybe  regular jujutsukai send morbidity  delivered straight into your youtube  feed but for now this has been the new  world review and i'll see you next time

